NO WARRANTY. This dataset contains HS6-level aggregates derived from published
US tariff data. It is provided for research and screening purposes only and is
not legal, customs or tax advice. Duty actually owed depends on the specific
8-10 digit tariff line, origin rules, trade programmes and entry date. Verify
at https://hts.usitc.gov/ before relying on any figure.
